whisper: A guest book web service, kept in guests.json.
whisper:   stellanova guestbook.stella        then open http://127.0.0.1:8080/
whisper:   /sign sends a message (the text sent along is "name: words"); /book gives every entry as saved text.

use: server
use: time

an entry has:
  name (text)
  words (text)
  when (text)
and the universe said i love you

the world remembers:
  book (a list of entries)
and the universe said i love you

to page, returning text:
  set out to "<h1>Guest book</h1>"
  for each e in reversed book:
    set out to out plus "<p><b>" plus (safe the name of e) plus "</b> (" plus the when of e plus "): " plus (safe the words of e) plus "</p>"
  return out
and the universe said i love you

to safe, given words (text), returning text:
  set out to replace "&" with "&amp;" in words
  set out to replace "<" with "&lt;" in out
  return replace ">" with "&gt;" in out
and the universe said i love you

to answer, given address (text), returning text:
  if address is "/": return page
  if address is "/book": return book as saved text
  if address is "/sign":
    set sent to the web message
    if not (sent contains ": "): return "Send it as 'name: words'."
    set cut to position of ": " in sent
    conjure an entry as e
    set the name of e to trimmed (letters 1 to (cut minus 1) of sent)
    set the words of e to trimmed (letters (cut plus 2) to (the size of sent) of sent)
    set the when of e to today plus " " plus the time now
    if the name of e is "" or the words of e is "": return "Send it as 'name: words'."
    add e to book
    save book to file "guests.json"
    return "Thank you, " plus the name of e plus "."
  return "There is no page " plus address plus "."
and the universe said i love you

genesis:
  if file "guests.json" exists: load book from file "guests.json"
  scrawl "Guest book at http://127.0.0.1:8080/"
  serve the web with (8080, the command answer)
and the universe said i love you
